  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the least value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is"
